op&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c481ac101d7dc8ae7d63045d39b7b52e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b578c74c/uploads/origins/54862dbe-08c1-49d4-ac60-cadc20768ba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=117cc63ee3603a8514deef82589da41d 3x"}, "body": "深夜打搅了~这次想请老师画我家的双胞胎。\n\n两姐妹都是独眼的，瞳色分别对应对方的发色。\n两人都很畏光，平时也都戴着眼纱。妹妹（黑皮那位）比姐姐更畏光，一直都闭眼。\n性格上姐姐比较活泼健谈，妹妹则沉默寡言像个玩偶儿一样。\n\n两姐妹的感情很好，可以的话想画两姐妹互动（比如姐姐帮妹妹编发之类的）\n麻烦老师啦！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1oWgHIfrW13-MXR_UW6HTHZZXN8jdxQQr", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xllkanaechu/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2694942, "client_id": 2931948, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de9aa79dd980fc782607586df5a57664", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de9aa79dd980fc782607586df5a57664, https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d46488152ecbcad2a80bc26a48ffcd12 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f831a72217cfd50ea9c0dec779a5be63 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=34765b934dcf6e2b1f5db4ac2cded930", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=34765b934dcf6e2b1f5db4ac2cded930, https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4fab62ec53a450797c755af9bff529dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a4f8f46/uploads/origins/88922f36-3118-4a1c-8d7e-90d164ff366d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=71af581741733e07ea5c813f42407fb0 3x"}, "body": "很高兴见到你，我叫 Nimicha，Vtuber。\n我在 skeb 上看到了你的插图。\n我是 Vtuber，我在 skeb 上看过你的插图。\n\n请求详情\n这次我想让你为我自己画一幅插图。\n我希望她穿着巫师形象的服装，而不是她原来的服装。我没有任何参考服装，所以就交给 Shuichi 大小姐了.....！\n你还可以改变发型等等。\n\nReference URL: https://twitter.com/nimi_pyon/status/1673294208994791425?s=46&t=5wXFm7mc_X1Lsm7gT91CWg\n\n预期用途\n可用于以下用途。\n用于 Twitter 等各种社交网络服务。\n在 YouTube 视频、视频发布和 VTuber 活动中使用缩略图。\n用于商品生产等商业用途。\n\n构图\n如果插图为 16:9，我们会很高兴，因为我们也希望将其用于壁纸。如果难度太大，也没关系！\n如果您能将姿势等交给我处理，我将不胜感激。\n如果您能尽可能提供差异等信息，我会非常高兴。\n\n其他\n如果可能，我们希望插图的尺寸大一些。\n我们希望收到透明的插图。\n\n如果可能的话，我希望您能把我画得看不见。\n如果由于设计原因难以做到，也没关系！", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xllkanaechu/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/adb5dae1/uploads/origins/51bacd29-0f82-4b70-86d8-83538794788f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3f178dfe51ab091b4932dfcf14d263af", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adb5dae1/uploads/origins/51bacd29-0f82-4b70-86d8-83538794788f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3f178dfe51ab091b4932dfcf14d263af, https://si.imgix.net/adb5dae1/uploads/origins/51bacd29-0f82-4b70-86d8-83538794788f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=cro